Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Stephen,

Thank you for your work on this! This is especially important with Bitnami
no longer offering free and versioned images for their Helm charts.

I personally would be interested in contributing and using an official
Kafka Helm chart through my organization and in my personal use.

Nick

On 2025/03/24 13:50:31 Stephen Askew wrote:
> Hi All,
>
> I've opened a new KIP-1149: Helm Chart for Apache Kafka<
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1149%3A+Helm+Chart+for+Apache+Kafka>
with the proposal to have an official Helm chart to deploy Apache Kafka to
Kubernetes.
>
> The initial Jira ticket (KAFKA-6416<
https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-6416>) requesting this was
created back in 2018, but now that the project has an official Docker
container image it would now seem appropriate to have a matching Helm chart.
>
> There is a draft PR<https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19249> in Github
with an initial stab at defining the solution for this.
>
> I look forward to seeing the discussion on this.
>
> Regards,
>
> Stephen.
>

--000000000000cf4ab3064287d4c5--

