I would like to start a discussion on KIP-1238: Multipartition for Topology=
TestDriver in Kafka Streams

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1238%3A+Multipartitio=
n+for+TopologyTestDriver+in+Kafka+Streams

