Hi all,

One more thing I'd like to bring up: I believe "share" should be completely
removed from the valid values list of
`group.coordinator.rebalance.protocols`
(i.e., specifying "share" is not allowed).

KIP-932 and the 4.1 docs don't mention enabling share groups via this
config.
Users only see "share" listed in the config's valid values. The config
description
implies that protocols not specified should be disabled, but share groups
actually
work even when "share" is not included in the config.

We can make this change in 4.2 since share groups are still in preview in
4.1.
Additionally, since the docs never describe using this config for share
groups, I
believe this change would be acceptable for the 4.2 release.

I've updated the KIP accordingly.

Best,
Ming-Yen

