> > >>>>>>>>>>>>>>> segment. It doesn=E2=80=99t update any transaction-rela=
ted
> > >>>> state
> > >>>>>>> for
> > >>>>>>>>> Diskless
> > >>>>>>>>>>>>>>> topics, because it doesn=E2=80=99t have any.
> > >>>>>>>>>>>>>>> 5. The WAL segment is committed to the batch
> > >>>> coordinator
