Great work Harish.

We are getting there.

A few more items for the home page:

1. Not sure why we changed the menu item from 'Powered by' to
'Testimonials'? If this was agreed upon in kip or any PRs, it's fine.
Otherwise, we should stick to the 'Powered by' menu item.

2. Instead of big search text box, replace it with a magnifying glass icon.
On click, it should display a text box underneath.

3. With the above change (point 2), we can wrap the 'DOWNLOAD' menu as a
gradient button.

4. Better we keep the same menu items

Get Started
Docs
Powered By
Community
Releases (added)
Apache

and Download as the last menu item.

And move the 'Blog' menu under 'Community'.
I think we don't need too many menu items.

6. Reduce the font size of menu items by 2 or 3 px.

7. Text color 'See full list' should be same as text color of 'Learn More'

8. The size of logo in the nav bar is a bit small. Can we increase its size
and move it closer to the menu items? Please see the current page.

9. Can we reduce the font size of text on cards like 'High Throughput' and
'Deliver messages at net....' and on all cards and rows below them?

10. Pls reduce the height of the footer and ensure it has a fair
background. (optional)

11. Footer text hyperlinks have a blue color. Pls keep the full text in the
same color. Pls see the existing documentation.

Please compare the current home page with the existing home page. Several
minute details matter. It would have been easier if we had a Figma design.
I can also help you with PR reviews, if you prefer it that way.

Let me know what is comfortable.

Thanks,
Murali


