    Fix Version/s: 4.2.0
       Resolution: Fixed

> Regex subscription should be empty for classic members joining mixed group
> --------------------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19720
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19720
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Dongnuo Lyu
>            Assignee: Dongnuo Lyu
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.2.0
>
>
> We don't recompute the assignment on consumer -> classic member replacement when the consumer member had a regex subscription and the classic member does not.
> We should explicitly set regex subscription to empty in classicGroupJoinToConsumerGroup



