Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable

Hi,
Slight modification to kip-1222. A new field AcquisitionLockTineoutMs
(int32) with version 2 will be added to ShareAcknowledgeResponse to
communicate to the share consumer the value of the renewed timeout.

This is in line with ShareFetchResponse.

It would be helpful if the timeout value is re-configured on the broker
side.

Regards,
Sushant Mahajan

On Tue, 7 Oct 2025, 15:46 Sushant Mahajan, <sushmahajn@gmail.com> wrote:

> I=E2=80=99d like to start the discussion for KIP-1222: Acquisition lock t=
imeout
> renewal in share consumer explicit mode.
>
> JIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19742
> KIP Wiki:
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1222%3A+Acquisition=
+lock+timeout+renewal+in+share+consumer+explicit+mode
>
> Regards,
> Sushant Mahajan
