Hi,
I would like to start discussion of a new KIP for detecting and handling mi=
srouted connections from Kafka clients. The Kafka protocol does not contain=
 any information for working out when the broker metadata information in a =
client is inconsistent or stale. This KIP proposes a way to address this.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1242%3A+Detection+and=
+handling+of+misrouted+connections

Thanks,
Andrew

