=A0offsets during/after the change, if=C2=A0the committed offset's epoch is=
 subsequently deleted due=C2=A0to retention=C2=A0policy, the consumer will =
encounter=C2=A0OFFSET_OUT_OF_RANGE=C2=A0error=C2=A0and reset to earliest=C2=
=A0(if=C2=A0auto.offset.reset=3Dearliest), causing=C2=A0massive=C2=A0messag=
e=C2=A0reprocessing.The=C2=A0root=C2=A0cause is that=C2=A0SubscriptionState=
.allConsumed()=C2=A0uses=C2=A0position.offsetEpoch=C2=A0instead of=C2=A0pos=
ition.currentLeader.epoch=C2=A0when=C2=A0constructing=C2=A0OffsetAndMetadat=
a=C2=A0for=C2=A0commit, which can=C2=A0become=C2=A0stale when=C2=A0leader=
=C2=A0changes occur.
