Hi Matthias,

I'm working on a draft KIP to deprecate the streams-scala module. Could =
you share the source of the usage statistics? I would like to cite it as =
a reference.

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/r4LMFw

Thank you,
PoAn

