>>> hi all,
>>>=20
>>> While reviewing https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20736, I =
noticed that
>>> streams-scala does not use Scoverage. Given the plan to eventually =
drop
>>> Scala support entirely, I'm questioning whether improving Scoverage =
for the
>>> streams-scala module is worthwhile, since that module would be =
included in
>>> the deprecation. Am I correct in this assessment?
>>> Best,
>>> Chia-Ping
>>>=20
>=20


