    Resolution: Resolved

> Ensure deterministic task order by using TreeSet in TaskManager
> ---------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19924
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19924
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>          Components: streams
>            Reporter: Shashank
>            Assignee: Shashank
>            Priority: Blocker
>             Fix For: 4.2.0
>
>
> Identified here - [https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20944#discussion_=
r2548625110]
> =C2=A0
> TaskManager's StateUpdater path uses HashSet for Task collections, causin=
g non-deterministic processing order. Replace with TreeSet to ensure determ=
inistic task ordering.



