Lucas Brutschy resolved KAFKA-19926.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Apply rebalance delay also for later epochs if the group is empty
> -----------------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19926
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19926
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Sub-task
>          Components: streams
>            Reporter: Lucas Brutschy
>            Assignee: travis
>            Priority: Major
>
> `streams.group.initial.rebalance.delay.ms` is currently only applied in the first rebalance. However, it would be better if it also applies in situations where we are at a higher group epoch, but the group is currently empty.



