Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-19939:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: ProductionExceptionHandler and DLQ does not support global thread
                 Key: KAFKA-19939
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19939
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


Follow up to https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19930

We should look into making the ProcessingExceptionHandler, and DLQ work for the global thread, too.

Depending on how we do this, this might require a KIP, as we might need to add a new producer to the global thread to support DLQ.



